config KSHIM_REGULATOR
    bool "Regulators from DT supplies (fixed GPIO and RPMh)"
    default n
    select KSHIM_GPIO
    help
        Resolve "<name>-supply" phandles to regulator-fixed rails with a GPIO
        enable and to RPMh VRM/XOB rails (CrDK CmdDBLib and RpmhLib polling
        API), with enable/disable reference counting. Fixed rails return to
        their inherited GPIO level before payload handoff; RPMh votes follow
        the policy in kshim/regulator.h.
